# Generated by digline. Run artifacts are ephemeral;
# baselines under <tenant>/baselines/ are meant to be committed.
*/runs/

# The operator's decision journal: every hold and every escalation, with the
# clause that ruled it. Append-forever and private, on the same footing as the
# run artifacts above — the reviewable artifact is a distillation of it, not
# the file itself. Ignored also keeps a cycle from dirtying the tree it is
# measuring: `git_commit` reads `git status --porcelain`, and a tracked journal
# written mid-cycle would stamp the very run it records as `-dirty`.
*/decisions/
